G3049.def:
λογίζομαι
(λόγος), [in LXX chiefly for חָשַׁב ;] 
__1. prop., of numerical calculation, to count, reckon: with accusative before μετά, Marc 15:23 (LXX) (Rec., R, mg.), Luc 22:37. 
__2. Metaphorical, without reference to numbers, by a reckoning of characteristics or reasons; 
__(a) to reckon, take into account: with accusative of thing(s), 1 Corinthiens 13:5; id. before dative of person(s), Romains 4:3 (LXX), Romains 4:4, 6 4:8" (LXX), 2 Corinthiens 5:19, 2 Timothée 4:16; before εἰς (cf. Heb. ל חָשַׁב; Bl., § 33, 3), Actes 19:27, Romains 2:26 4:3, 5 4:9-11, 22-24 9:8 Galates 3:6" (LXX), Jacques 2:23 (LXX); 
__(b) to consider, calculate: with accusative of thing(s), Philippiens 4:8; before ὅτι, Jean 11:50, Hébreux 11:10; τοῦτο, ὅτι, 2 Corinthiens 10:11; with accusative of person(s), with inf., Romains 6:11; before ὡς, Romains 8:36 (LXX); 
__(with) to suppose, judge, deem: 1 Corinthiens 13:11; ὡς, 1 Pierre 5:12; οὕτως, 1 Corinthiens 4:1; with accusative of thing(s), 2 Corinthiens 3:5; id. before εἰς, 2 Corinthiens 12:6; ὅτι, Romains 8:18; τοῦτο, ὅτι, Romains 2:3, 2 Corinthiens 10:7; with inf., 2 Corinthiens 11:5; accusative and inf., Romains 3:28 14:14, Philippiens 3:13; with accusative of person(s) before ὡς, 2 Corinthiens 10:2; 
__(d) to purpose, decide: with inf. (Eur., Or., 555), 2 Corinthiens 10:2 
(cf. ἀνα-, δια-, παρα-, συλ-λογίζομαι).†
